====== ZyXEL NSA3xx ======

The Zyxel NSA310, NSA310b, NSA310s, NSA320, NSA325 is a [[docs:techref:targets:kirkwood|Kirkwood]] based [[docs:guide-user:services:nas:start|NAS (aka Network Attached Storage)]] with one or two <abbr>HDD [Hard Disk Drive]</abbr> bay using <abbr>SATA [Serial ATA]</abbr>.

