|**NSA310s**| [[https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/21.02.1/targets/kirkwood/generic/u-boot-nsa310s/|uboot-NSA310s delivered with OpenWRT 21.02.1]]| OpenWrt Image NSA310s working|
|**NSA320**|[[https://bitly.com/2iC3E69|uboot.2017.07-tld-1.nsa320.bodhi.tar]]| [[https://forum.openwrt.org/t/support-for-zyxel-nsa320/18572/7|Not supported by OpenWrt]]|
